{"id":3119,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eLz6yRMzvYUmQfUhzCao77iozlZU4f37MN-ZUzfRnmr7Mz70gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVUSysLSybLzGbolQVnNlsUzG4LlW2LmLio7LPMNr7nzTFL774oRfknzMFLzLaM4LJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0EA7191099FEFE7A031BF2358C16EDE9/0A380BE3/13073\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 195px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eLz6yRMzvYUmQfUhzCao77iozlZU4f37MN-ZUzfRnmr7Mz70gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVUSysLSybLzGbolQVnNlsUzG4LlW2LmLio7LPMNr7nzTFL774oRfknzMFLzLaM4LJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p><p>谭雅静，土家族，湖南株洲人，共青团员，计算机科学与技术学院数据科学与大数据技术专业2022级本科生，担任分科协竞赛部部长，2025年国家奖学金获得者，现已推免至深圳大学人工智能学院人工智能专业攻读硕士学位。</p><p>大学期间，谭雅静在学业与综合素质方面表现突出，曾获得国家奖学金、综合素质一等奖学金、二等奖学金，并荣获“优秀学生干部”称号，充分展现了扎实的专业基础与全面发展的良好风貌。在学科竞赛方面，她积极参与华北五省计算机设计大赛、中国大学生计算机设计大赛、中国大学生智能照明和智能穿戴创新创业大赛、“互联网+”大学生创新创业大赛等赛事，累计获得国家级奖项两项、省级奖项一项、校级奖项数十项，现已推免至深圳大学人工智能学院人工智能专业攻读硕士学位。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eMlWyfoRrVMRUbnh77bM4nRUmVVLlW3fMlL4LlCsL8U8M7L0gihFp2hmCIa0nky4L1h7Lky8L7MfLzr2ozA2Mz7aM8WkUz9YM4NYU8UZMRVFUz9anzQ7nlVFMzV2nlUJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D32D040CA15F98F5107BBA82792CD841/A80E6DEA/51FED\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 318px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eMl-yiL4Niozv4Uh8WkMmGbnl7ZoRM3VnN74UNn7MmrVL8C0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyYnky8UShRLzA7U8l4nmNZoRNDnlM2M7l8LzWfMlnRnlVFMzMfL4AfUlVFUz6RoR9Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\"></p><p><strong>以信仰为帆，锚定成长航向</strong></p><p>自入学以来，谭雅静始终以高度的政治自觉和昂扬的进取精神向党组织靠拢，把与时俱进的精神状态与坚定的理想信念融入大学成长的每一步。这份信仰不仅成为她思想进步的坚实基础，更转化为学业与实践中持续奋进的内在动力，使她在成长路上始终目标明确、步伐坚定。</p><p><strong>以责任为桨，扬起服务之帆</strong></p><p><br></p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eo7nyRLzCsUmM7Uh4AVn77bU4QRMNL3anmlDMmCaM4n2MN70gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh7oShVL1h7LR78U8lPM7UiMm78LmC4L8M7M778nlUZoRnFMm-DolL4LznFLzQknRUJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0D9E2D014CE14D56142633CD4A4ED884/6269C314/16BD4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eo7nyRLzCsUmM7Uh4AVn77bU4QRMNL3anmlDMmCaM4n2MN70gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh7oShVL1h7LR78U8lPM7UiMm78LmC4L8M7M778nlUZoRnFMm-DolL4LznFLzQknRUJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=enRNyYLzW7Ll7iUhll8U4V7nlrVolM3fU4LbL4GiMlnkM8C0gihFp2hmCIa0oSh2nSyinkhkUmQfozMkozQ7Uz9DnmGaUln2Ulr7MRvYnR6FU4v8UzGZnzrFnRQVnSbaptveo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLRC4LYbw62B8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9FE5DBB6A93B96DA86F00ADFAED472D7/C74A08E5/D6EE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=enRNyYLzW7Ll7iUhll8U4V7nlrVolM3fU4LbL4GiMlnkM8C0gihFp2hmCIa0oSh2nSyinkhkUmQfozMkozQ7Uz9DnmGaUln2Ulr7MRvYnR6FU4v8UzGZnzrFnRQVnSbaptveo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLRC4LYbw62B8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eUlUyaolQ2nmnVMhmCbMlUZLlCiLRl3YUzLsUlLsUzl4L4l0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hfU1hfnkyaL8-DL4CYUznVMz-iMzV7L4f2ozlaLlQVozVFM8-sL8C8MmnFLlrRLNCJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6ABAD03B6362A4E52551D30F9501FE91/7B73F464/1EC2F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eUlUyaolQ2nmnVMhmCbMlUZLlCiLRl3YUzLsUlLsUzl4L4l0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hfU1hfnkyaL8-DL4CYUznVMz-iMzV7L4f2ozlaLlQVozVFM8-sL8C8MmnFLlrRLNCJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p>作为分科协竞赛部部长，谭雅静以严谨务实的态度认真履职尽责，从竞赛方案撰写、报名组织，到评委邀请、现场统筹，她与团队密切协作、稳步推进每一个环节，助力学院竞赛工作有序开展，并因此获评优秀学生干部。在志愿服务领域，她同样积极投入、持续前行：连续三年担任中国大学生计算机设计大赛志愿者，荣获省级优秀志愿者称号；参与“三下乡”社会实践、蓝桥杯省赛志愿等活动，累计服务时长超100小时，还获评学院优秀志愿者，以实际行动践行“奉献、友爱、互助、进步”的志愿精神。</p><p><strong>以学业为楫，划开知识蓝海</strong></p><p>在学业上，谭雅静始终保持勤奋刻苦的学习态度，持续拓展专业知识的深度与广度。本科期间，她平均学分绩点达4.49，三十余门课程成绩在90分以上现已推免到深圳大学。在学科竞赛中，她勇于探索、敢于创新，在中国大学生智能照明和智能穿戴创新创业大赛中获得国家特等奖、在华北五省计算机设计大赛中获得国家三等奖，同时还斩获省级、校级奖项数十项，以扎实的专业能力交出亮眼的学习答卷。</p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eL8QykozMkLmGZohR9iM8VfolU8MN734U8LbUNW7U8V2M7-0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhkMSybM1h7UzUPL8-8nm94LmffU4vYU8r7LNUbL4vZUlQFMm9bozr7LmrFLmGDMmUJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4B596DA413B4F8320AC72CED2D9378AF/68995D25/20664\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 236px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eL8QykozMkLmGZohR9iM8VfolU8MN734U8LbUNW7U8V2M7-0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhkMSybM1h7UzUPL8-8nm94LmffU4vYU8r7LNUbL4vZUlQFMm9bozr7LmrFLmGDMmUJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eUm-yZMzQ7Mz98nhlM2LmUZnzCYLNC3snRf2U4f7n7-PnRL0gihFp2hmCIa0oSysLSyPLSyDLm62olr2nlLaU8Lbn7rknRN4MRlYM4LZUzVFozGaUm94nlVFLm78MR7Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/97111627F9EFEC0CC9DEBD93452738A1/900B83EA/21441\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 264px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eUm-yZMzQ7Mz98nhlM2LmUZnzCYLNC3snRf2U4f7n7-PnRL0gihFp2hmCIa0oSysLSyPLSyDLm62olr2nlLaU8Lbn7rknRN4MRlYM4LZUzVFozGaUm94nlVFLm78MR7Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/vi