mnfnmNJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eU8-yaMmlao7CaohzGiUzN4nlVRMzQ32nRWRL4VfMz7ZLzl0gihFp2hmCIa0MSybnkyYnSy8nzVfL7-ZM77DnRCiMmCin774nzG4UmnRL4TFL8QkMmG8o7nFLmUDoRlJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/59D2E4E1A0B84A6D65665DA3E03B4C39/3FB6048D/24685\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 255px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eU8-yaMmlao7CaohzGiUzN4nlVRMzQ32nRWRL4VfMz7ZLzl0gihFp2hmCIa0MSybnkyYnSy8nzVfL7-ZM77DnRCiMmCin774nzG4UmnRL4TFL8QkMmG8o7nFLmUDoRlJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>青春寄语</strong><br></p><p>大学时光不仅是知识积累的阶段，更是自我塑造与能力提升的持续修行。谭雅静在学业中深耕专业、在竞赛中攻坚克难、在学生工作中勇担责任、在志愿服务中传递温暖，深刻体会到成长是多维度并进、相互成就的过程。成功来自长期积累与持续精进，她始终以专注打磨技能、以坚韧迎接挑战，在求知与成长的道路上不断进阶、稳步前行。</p><p><strong>栏目简介：</strong></p><p>《青春榜样志》聚焦于计算机科学与技术学院涌现出的优秀青年学子，记录他们在学业深耕、科研创新与实践奉献中留下的坚实足迹，展现新时代大学生将个人理想锚定时代需求、勇担使命的昂扬风貌，以榜样之光，照亮更多青年的逐梦航向。</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://cst.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eLz6yRMzvYUmQfUhzCao77iozlZU4f37MN-ZUzfRnmr7Mz70gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVUSysLSybLzGbolQVnNlsUzG4LlW2LmLio7LPMNr7nzTFL774oRfknzMFLzLaM4LJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDL4LJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10633&e=.png"}